{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2022-04-12 16:30:00', 'title': 'DANAHER ANNOUNCES CONVERSION DATE FOR SERIES A MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'WASHINGTON , APRIL 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS 4.75% SERIES A MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK (THE "PREFERRED STOCK"), WILL AUTOMATICALLY CONVERT INTO SHARES OF THE COMPANY\'S COMMON STOCK ON APRIL 15, 2022 (THE "CONVERSION DATE"). THE CONVERSION RATE FOR EACH SHARE OF PREFERRED STOCK WILL BE 6.6632 SHARES OF THE COMPANY\'S COMMON STOCK.'}